133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (Urban areas face a paradox where large amounts of surplus food are wasted daily while many people still struggle with food insecurity. Existing food redistribution methods rely heavily on manual coordination through calls or messages, which leads to delays, inefficiencies, and increased chances of food spoilage. This lack of a structured, real-time system makes it difficult to connect donors with nearby NGOs effectively. To address this, NourishShare proposes a smart, technology-driven solution that leverages geospatial matching and real-time data to enable faster, more efficient, and scalable food redistribution.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
